========================================
MULTIPLE TRANSITIONS – SHORT NOTE
========================================

Definition:
-----------
Multiple transitions allow you to animate
more than one CSS property at the same time.

Syntax:
-------

transition: property1 duration timing-function delay,
            property2 duration timing-function delay;


Example Structure:
------------------

transition: background-color 0.5s ease,
            transform 0.5s ease;


Key Points:
-----------

• Separate each property using a comma (,).
• Each property can have its own duration.
• Each property can have its own timing-function.
• Each property can have its own delay.
• You can also use 'all' to animate all properties.


Simple Meaning:
---------------

Multiple transitions = Smooth animation of
multiple properties together.s